            <div xml:id="d490">

                <pb facs="0498" n="492" xml:id="pg492"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851R.00/120: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom (Matthews) to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-25T02:00:00+01:00">December 25,
                            1942—2 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 24—10:41 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7347. Radio Algiers has just announced that Admiral Darlan was attacked and
                    subsequently died this afternoon and that his assassin was caught and is being
                    questioned.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
